{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21202","headline":"酬乐天早夏见怀 · 元稹","name":"酬乐天早夏见怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庭柚有垂实，燕巢无宿雏。\n我亦辞社燕，茫茫焉所如。\n君诗夏方早，我叹秋已徂。\n食物风土异，衾裯时节殊。\n荒草满田地，近移江上居。\n八日复切九，月明侵半除。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21202.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21202","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}